hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"21010","Abd al-Razzaq narrated to us, Ibn Jurayj informed us, Abd al-Karim informed me, from Habib ibn Mikhnaf, he said: I reached the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) on the day of Arafah, he said, while he was saying: do you know it? He said: I do not know what they answered him. He said: then the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: upon every household is to slaughter a sheep in every Rajab and in every Adha a sheep."
"21011","Muadh ibn Muadh narrated to us, Ibn Awn narrated to us, he said: Abu Ramlah informed me, from Mikhnaf ibn Sulaym, Rawh al-Ghamidi said: while we were standing with the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) at Arafah, he said: O people, upon the people of every house in every year is a sacrifice and an Atirah. Do you know what the Atirah is? It is what the people call al-Rajabiyyah."
